/**
md-index.gadx — default Markdown index template for `gad doc`.

One is generated per output directory as README.md. It receives:
  param (index dict) = { name: str, path: str,
    items: [ { name: str, file: str } ],   // documented files in this dir
    dirs:  [ { name: str, file: str } ] }   // subdirectory indexes
where item.file / dir.file are the links to write (already .md-suffixed and,
for dirs, pointing at the subdirectory's README.md).
**/
~~
param (index dict)

write("# " + index.name + "\n")

if index.items {
    write("\n## Files\n\n")
    for it in index.items {
        write("- [" + it.name + "](" + it.file + ")\n")
    }
}

if index.dirs {
    write("\n## Subdirectories\n\n")
    for d in index.dirs {
        write("- [" + d.name + "](" + d.file + ")\n")
    }
}
~~
